    "section": "四、重连 / 回放",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "只补数据时不回应服务端、不改变界面",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-048",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "按服务端座位顺序把每个玩家的累计分写入玩家数据，作为头像显示分数的来源",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-049",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/普通房玩家头像",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "普通房该家头像上的分数文本刷新",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-050",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/匹配场玩家头像",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "匹配场头像分数刷新；匹配分数文本做数字缩写，正分用亮黄色、非正分用白色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-051",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响/第1条",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "头像分数是累计分，与桌面结算播放的本局飘分动画是两套显示",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-052",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响/第2条",
    "fromLine": 19,
    "toLine": 19,
    "text": "结算消息会再次覆盖累计分，本消息先后顺序不会造成最终分数错误",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-053",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/19-玩家分数.md",
    "section": "四、重连 / 回放",
    "fromLine": 23,
    "toLine": 23,
    "text": "重连补数据时只记录分数，不刷新头像",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-054",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "开头说明/什么时候出现",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "一局结束、胡牌动画播完后弹出，固定延迟约 3 秒；回放模式收到结算时直接弹出",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-055",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "一、数据来源/第1条",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "使用胡牌或流局结算保存的完整结算数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-056",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "一、数据来源/第2条",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "组装显示内容：庄家、庄家等级、连庄数（与桌面庄家标记同源，不用结算覆盖值）、每家得失分、玩家手牌、胡牌明细、结束类型、流水文案、剩余牌墙、承包结算、加倍信息",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-057",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/小结算界面",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "小结算界面打开，替换在游戏画面之上",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-058",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/玩家列表区",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "每家一行：头像、昵称、所在方位（自己/下家/对家/上家）、庄家标记（萧山为可变等级）、手牌与副露、胡牌类型与倍数、本局流水、承保标记、加倍状态",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-059",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/左下角财神牌",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "左下角财神牌显示本局财神牌",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-060",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/公共结算外壳",
    "fromLine": 17,
    "toLine": 17,
    "text": "公共结算外壳提供关闭或继续、查看总结算、安全中心、洗牌道具等公共按钮，由公共结算界面负责",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-061",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化/手机震动",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "自己胡且番型含平胡以外内容时短震一次，回放不震",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-062",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响/第1条",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "小结算弹出后紧接着通知主界面延迟 2 秒弹出总战绩",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-063",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响/第2条",
    "fromLine": 23,
    "toLine": 23,
    "text": "公共结算界面监听一批公共消息，用于刷新安全按钮、洗牌道具数量、预约洗牌状态与查看总结算按钮",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-064",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响/第3条",
    "fromLine": 24,
    "toLine": 24,
    "text": "长按小结算会让桌面上的财神牌高亮，松手取消",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-065",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意 / 风险/第1条",
    "fromLine": 28,
    "toLine": 28,
    "text": "弹出时间固定 3 秒，与飘分动画时长无联动，改动画时长需同时考虑这 3 秒",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-066",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意 / 风险/第2条",
    "fromLine": 29,
    "toLine": 29,
    "text": "只有平胡不触发震动，其余任何番型都会震动，新增基础番型需同步调整",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-067",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意 / 风险/第3条",
    "fromLine": 30,
    "toLine": 30,
    "text": "回放模式下在收到结算时直接弹出，不等待 3 秒",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-068",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/38-小结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意 / 风险/第4条",
    "fromLine": 31,
    "toLine": 31,
    "text": "玩家列表依赖结算界面资源导出的对应组件，缺失会退化为逐行列表兜底样式并在日志提示",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-069",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第1条",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "把玩家的总结算记录按座位排序",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-070",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第2条",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "汇总每家总得失分、已打局数、创房最大局数、开始结束时间、房主名、玩法名、房间与对局标识、解散者等",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-071",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第3条",
    "fromLine": 9,
    "toLine": 9,
    "text": "解析每位玩家的详细统计并生成展示条目",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-072",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第3条/条目表",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "展示条目胡：胡了几次",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-073",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第3条/条目表",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "展示条目爆头：爆头几次",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-074",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第3条/条目表",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "展示条目财飘：财飘几次",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-075",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第3条/条目表",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "展示条目财神：摸到财神几次",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-076",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么/第4条",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "保存为总战绩数据，供总战绩界面使用",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-077",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "本消息不直接打开任何界面",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-078",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "三、真正的弹窗时机/游戏控制器统一处理",
    "fromLine": 27,
    "toLine": 27,
    "text": "游戏控制器统一处理时标记游戏已结束并停止安全监控",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-079",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "三、真正的弹窗时机/游戏控制器统一处理",
    "fromLine": 28,
    "toLine": 28,
    "text": "若处于回放、或房间被解散且不是机器人解散，则直接弹出总战绩界面",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-080",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "三、真正的弹窗时机/游戏控制器统一处理",
    "fromLine": 29,
    "toLine": 29,
    "text": "同时通知小结算界面切换到查看总结算按钮",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-081",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "三、真正的弹窗时机/正常对局",
    "fromLine": 30,
    "toLine": 30,
    "text": "正常对局胡牌结算播完后通知主界面，主界面延迟 2 秒弹出总战绩，已标记不弹则跳过",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-082",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "四、注意/第1条",
    "fromLine": 34,
    "toLine": 34,
    "text": "某位玩家统计解析失败时会被跳过，战绩条目数量可能少于玩家数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R04-083",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/39-总战绩.md",
    "section": "四、注意/第2条",
    "fromLine": 35,
    "toLine": 35,
    "text": "已打局数和最大局数都取创房设置；若需区分实际已打与房间设置需改此处",
    "mandatory": true
  }
]
